  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Really comparing",
     "texto": [
      "You already know **hơn** (more than) and **nhất** (the most). Three pieces are missing:",
      "**A + adjective + bằng + B** = A is **just as**… as B (same measure): «Phòng này **rộng bằng** phòng kia» = This room is just as big as that one.",
      "**A + adjective + như + B** = A is as… **as** B (they resemble each other, it's an image): «Nhà sạch **như** khách sạn» = The house is as clean as a hotel.",
      "**A + không + adjective + bằng + B** = A **is not as**… as B: «Căn này **không đẹp bằng** căn kia» = This flat isn't as nice as that one. It's the polite way of saying \"it's worse\".",
      "To measure the difference: **hơn nhiều** (much more), **hơn một chút** (a bit more), **hơn hẳn** (clearly more), **gấp đôi** (twice as much): «đắt **gấp đôi**»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
